{"id":"m8fc9lgs65f0habdy4or2tp9h","title":"富达短期债券基金第三季度报告","originalTitle":"Fidelity Short-Term Bond Fund Q3 2026 Commentary","summary":"富达短期债券基金在第三季度的表现逊于基准的 Bloomberg U.S. 1-3 Year Government/ Credit Bond Index，期间美国可征税投资级债券指数下跌 3.51%。美联储在9月16日将基准短期利率上调25个基点至3.75%-4.0%区间，10年期国债收益率同期上升85个基点至5.29%。截至季度末，基金约40%的资产投资于企业债券。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha"},"links":{"original":"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4969883-fidelity-short-term-bond-fund-q3-2026-commentary?source=feed_all_articles"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T01:30:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T01:44:14.814Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T01:44:14.814Z","category":"macro","tags":["行情异动","美联储"],"score":41,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"e0f581bf-44ab-4a77-ae55-90da69cdfa4f","title":"富达债券基金Q3下跌3.51% 美联储加息致收益率攀升"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"e0f581bf-44ab-4a77-ae55-90da69cdfa4f","title":"富达债券基金Q3下跌3.51% 美联储加息致收益率攀升"}],"topics":[{"slug":"rates","name":"利率与流动性"},{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f5TjB3CDTyzs","reportCount":2,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}